{
    "title": "News18: Daily News & Updates",
    "description": "News18 is the flagship digital news destination of Network18, India\u2019s largest news and media conglomerate, and is also the digital face of the News18 network\u2019s leading television news channels that include market leaders such as CNN-News18, News18 India, News18 Lokmat, News18 Bangla and many more.\r\n \r\nNEWS & LIVE TV IN 12 LANGUAGES:\r\nNews18 is currently available in 12 different languages spanning the length and breadth of India. The News18 app offers news and live TV in English, Hindi, Bengali, Marathi, Gujarati, Kannada, Tamil, Malayalam, Telugu, Punjabi, Assamese and Odia. The app allows you to select the language of your choice and set your default television channel.\r\n \r\nPERSONALIZED NEWS BASED ON YOUR INTERESTS:\r\nNews18 offers you a personalized news experience, based on your interests. Select the categories of news you are interested in, and find a personalized feed of curated news based on the categories you have selected. News18 offers a wide range of news categories: Politics, Technology, Business, Gadgets, Sports, Auto, Lifestyle, World, India, Health & Fitness, Football, Cricket, Opinion, Entertainment.\r\n \r\nBOOKMARKS & OFFLINE READING MODE:\r\nNews18 is a multi-platform news destination and is an amalgamation of the highest standards of journalism and cutting-edge technology and design. The News18 app brings you the latest news across text, photo and video formats. You can easily switch between reading the news and watching it live on television in the language of your choice. If you see something you want to come back to, you can bookmark it and visit it later. You can save articles, photos and videos in your bookmarks. If you know you are going to have poor network connectivity, you can download articles, photos and videos to consume later in offline mode.\r\n \r\nAWARD-WINNING JOURNALISM:\r\nNews18 is known for its high-quality and award-winning journalism and is one of the top digital news destinations in India. News18 draws its strength from its unmatched network of thousands of journalists who bring in news as it happens from every nook and corner of the country. This also makes News18 the default destination for any breaking news.\r\n \r\n15 LIVE TELEVISION CHANNELS ON THE GO\r\n1. CNN News18\r\n2. News18 India\r\n3. News18 Punjab, Haryana, Himachal\r\n4. News18 Rajasthan\r\n5. News18 Uttar Pradesh, Uttarakhand\r\n6. News18 Bihar, Jharkhand\r\n7. News18 Madhya Pradesh, Chhattisgarh\r\n8. News18 Bangla\r\n9. News18 Odia\r\n10. News18 Gujarati\r\n11. News18 Assam North East\r\n12. News18 Kannada\r\n13. News18 Tamil\r\n14. News18 Kerala\r\n15. News18 Lokmat\r\n \r\nREAD AND SHARE:\r\n\u2022 Latest Indian and international news\r\n\u2022 Breaking news in 12 languages\r\n\u2022 Videos and LiveTV\r\n\u2022 Photo galleries\r\n\u2022 Live cricket score\r\n\u2022 News: Politics, Technology, Business, Gadgets, Sports, Auto, Lifestyle, World, India, Health & Fitness, Football, Cricket, Opinion, Entertainment\r\n\u2022 Union Budget 2024 highlights, budget news, union budget news, budget 2024, budget 2024 news, india budget, budget india news\r\n\u2022 Get real-time election updates, analysis, poll results, and key insights on candidates and constituencies only on News18.\r\n \r\nFOLLOW US ON FACEBOOK / TWITTER:\r\n \r\nEnglish - https://www.facebook.com/cnnnews18\r\n@CNNnews18\r\n \r\nHindi - https://www.facebook.com/News18Hindi\r\n@News18India\r\n \r\nBangla - https://www.facebook.com/News18Bangla\r\n@News18Bengali\r\n \r\nGujarati - https://www.facebook.com/News18Gujarati\r\n@News18Guj\r\n \r\nUrdu - https://www.facebook.com/News18Urdu\r\n@News18Urdu\r\n \r\nMarathi - https://www.facebook.com/News18Lokmat\r\n@News18lokmat\r\n \r\nKannada - https://www.facebook.com/News18Kannada\r\n@News18Kannada\r\n \r\nTamil - https://www.facebook.com/News18TamilNadu\r\n@News18TamilNadu\r\n \r\nMalayalam - https://www.facebook.com/News18Kerala\r\n@News18Kerala\r\n \r\nTelugu - https://www.facebook.com/News18Telugu\r\n@News18Telugu\r\n \r\nPunjabi - https://www.facebook.com/News18Punjab\r\n@News18Punjab\r\n \r\nUrdu - https://www.facebook.com/News18Urdu\r\n@News18Urdu",
