 destinations in India. News18 draws its strength from its unmatched network of thousands of journalists who bring in news as it happens from every nook and corner of the country. This also makes News18 the default destination for any breaking news.<br> <br>15 LIVE TELEVISION CHANNELS ON THE GO<br>1. CNN News18<br>2. News18 India<br>3. News18 Punjab, Haryana, Himachal<br>4. News18 Rajasthan<br>5. News18 Uttar Pradesh, Uttarakhand<br>6. News18 Bihar, Jharkhand<br>7. News18 Madhya Pradesh, Chhattisgarh<br>8. News18 Bangla<br>9. News18 Odia<br>10. News18 Gujarati<br>11. News18 Assam North East<br>12. News18 Kannada<br>13. News18 Tamil<br>14. News18 Kerala<br>15. News18 Lokmat<br> <br>READ AND SHARE:<br>\u2022 Latest Indian and international news<br>\u2022 Breaking news in 12 languages<br>\u2022 Videos and LiveTV<br>\u2022 Photo galleries<br>\u2022 Live cricket score<br>\u2022 News: Politics, Technology, Business, Gadgets, Sports, Auto, Lifestyle, World, India, Health &amp; Fitness, Football, Cricket, Opinion, Entertainment<br>\u2022 Union Budget 2024 highlights, budget news, union budget news, budget 2024, budget 2024 news, india budget, budget india news<br>\u2022 Get real-time election updates, analysis, poll results, and key insights on candidates and constituencies only on News18.<br> <br>FOLLOW US ON FACEBOOK / TWITTER:<br> <br>English - https://www.facebook.com/cnnnews18<br>@CNNnews18<br> <br>Hindi - https://www.facebook.com/News18Hindi<br>@News18India<br> <br>Bangla - https://www.facebook.com/News18Bangla<br>@News18Bengali<br> <br>Gujarati - https://www.facebook.com/News18Gujarati<br>@News18Guj<br> <br>Urdu - https://www.facebook.com/News18Urdu<br>@News18Urdu<br> <br>Marathi - https://www.facebook.com/News18Lokmat<br>@News18lokmat<br> <br>Kannada - https://www.facebook.com/News18Kannada<br>@News18Kannada<br> <br>Tamil - https://www.facebook.com/News18TamilNadu<br>@News18TamilNadu<br> <br>Malayalam - https://www.facebook.com/News18Kerala<br>@News18Kerala<br> <br>